[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
SMS Gateway has been installed under:

  %%WWWDIR%%

To configure a Huawei HiLink LTE dongle now and persist the rc.d settings, run:

  %%WWWDIR%%/hw/FreeBSD/install-huawei-lte.sh --target hilink

The package creates %%WWWDIR%%/config/local.php from local.php.sample only if it
is missing, and creates %%SMS_GATEWAY_DBDIR%% for the SQLite SMS cache. Review
%%WWWDIR%%/config/local.php before testing authenticated endpoints.

The hardware command enables sms_gateway in rc.conf after a successful target
run.

Create an enabled API token entry:

  %%WWWDIR%%/config/set_token.sh

The helper writes %%WWWDIR%%/config/tokens.json with "enabled": true by default.
Store the generated token securely; only its SHA-256 hash is saved.

On subsequent boots, the rc.d service will run the hardware setup automatically.

To review status without changing configuration:

  service sms_gateway status

If the APACHE option was enabled, check and reload Apache after configuration:

  apachectl configtest
  service apache24 reload
EOM
}
]
